  /// taxonomy or "Export my data" never breaks it. Empty = a free-text skill, as before.
  taxonomyCode  String   @default("")
  taxonomyLabel String   @default("")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  // P5-02: whose it is. Every row has an owner; existing rows belong to the owner account ("owner").
